Package: tctHelpers
Title: Helper Functions for Multi-Outcome Targeted Test Simulations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Multi-Outcome-TCT", "Author", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Internal helper functions (working-model construction, GLS
    fitting, targeted tests, contrast matrices, and local-power utilities)
    used by the multi-outcome-TCT project. Packaging these functions gives
    their closures a stable namespace (instead of .GlobalEnv), which is
    required for them to work correctly inside parallel (future/furrr)
    workers.
